sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Commerce as Commerce (Next.js 16 MFE)
	participant Ordering as Ordering API (.NET 11 + Postgres/Marten)
	participant Kafka as Kafka (CloudEvents)
	participant Finance as Finance (Durable Functions)
	participant Basket as Basket API (.NET 11 + Redis)
	participant Notify as Notification (.NET 11 Worker)

	Commerce ->> Ordering: HTTPS POST /ordering/api/v1/orders
	Ordering ->> Ordering: Resolve Basket & Catalog gRPC, save New order
	Ordering -->> Commerce: 201 Created (orderId)
	Ordering ->> Kafka: UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent
	Kafka ->> Finance: Start OrderOrchestrator (finance-taskhub)
	Finance ->> Kafka: PlaceOrderCommand
	Kafka ->> Basket: Delete customer basket
	Kafka ->> Notify: Send placement email
	Ordering ->> Kafka: OrderStatusChangedToComplete / CancelIntegrationEvent
	Kafka ->> Finance: Finalize OrderOrchestrator
	Finance ->> Kafka: CompleteOrderCommand / CancelOrderCommand
	Kafka ->> Notify: Send completion or cancellation email
